msgstr "Anzeigename."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:106
msgid "Moon Sign"
msgstr "Mondzeichen"

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:107
msgid ""
"The Moon's sign, degree and house from a birth chart. Answers \"what is my "
"moon sign\" on its own, without the whole chart around it."
msgstr ""
"Das Zeichen, der Grad und das Haus des Mondes aus einem Geburtshoroskop. "
"Beantwortet die Frage „Was ist mein Mondzeichen?“ eigenständig, ohne das "
"gesamte Horoskop drumherum."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:113
msgid ""
"WGS-84 latitude. Only affects the house shown; the sign is the same "
"anywhere."
msgstr ""
"WGS-84 Breitengrad. Beeinflusst nur das angezeigte Haus; das Zeichen ist "
"überall gleich."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:116
#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:131
msgid "Display name in the heading."
msgstr "Name in der Überschrift."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:121
msgid "Rising Sign"
msgstr "Aszendent"

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:122
msgid ""
"The rising sign with its chart ruler and the Midheaven. Coordinates are "
"required: the ascendant is the horizon at a place."
msgstr ""
"Der Aszendent mit seinem Horoskopherrscher und dem Medium Coeli. Koordinaten"
" sind erforderlich: Der Aszendent ist der Horizont an einem Ort."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:128
msgid ""
"WGS-84 latitude. Without it the card renders nothing rather than the wrong "
"horizon."
msgstr ""
"WGS-84 Breitengrad. Ohne ihn rendert die Karte nichts, anstatt den falschen "
"Horizont anzuzeigen."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:136
msgid "Daily Tarot Card"
msgstr "Tarotkarte des Tages"

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:137
msgid "Single card pull of the day from a chosen deck."
msgstr "Einmalige Tagesziehung aus einem gewählten Deck."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:141
msgid ""
"Deck slug: rider-waite (default), marseille, or lenormand. Only rider-waite "
"renders into the page; the other two load in a frame."
msgstr ""
"Kartendeck: rider-waite (Standard), marseille oder lenormand. Nur rider-"
"waite wird in die Seite gerendert; die anderen beiden laden in einem Frame."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:146
msgid "Tarot Spread of the Day"
msgstr "Tarot-Legung des Tages"

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:147
msgid ""
"Past, present and future, or the Celtic Cross, drawn once a day for this "
"site, each card read in its position. Rendered into the page; no key needed."
msgstr ""
"Vergangenheit, Gegenwart und Zukunft oder das Keltische Kreuz, einmal am Tag"
" für diese Website gezogen, jede Karte in ihrer Position gedeutet. Wird in "
"die Seite gerendert; kein Schlüssel nötig."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:151
msgid ""
"three-card (default) for past, present and future, or celtic-cross for the "
"Celtic Cross."
msgstr ""
"three-card (Standard) für Vergangenheit, Gegenwart und Zukunft oder celtic-"
"cross für das Keltische Kreuz."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:152
msgid ""
"yes (default) shows a Draw again button that deals the visitor a new spread,"
" not kept or cached; no hides it."
msgstr ""
"yes (Standard) zeigt eine Schaltfläche \"Neu ziehen\", die Besuchern eine "
"neue Legung gibt, weder gespeichert noch zwischengespeichert; no blendet sie"
" aus."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:157
msgid "Mini Birth Chart"
msgstr "Mini-Geburtshoroskop"

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:158
msgid "The natal wheel drawn small, for a sidebar. Loads in a frame."
msgstr ""
"Das Geburtshoroskop-Rad, klein für eine Seitenleiste. Lädt in einem Frame."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:167
#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:179
#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:190
#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:205
#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:216
#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:230
#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:243
#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:276
msgid "light (default), dark or console."
msgstr "light (Standard), dark oder console."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:172
msgid "Monthly Forecast"
msgstr "Monatsprognose"

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:173
msgid ""
"Four weeks ahead for one sign, each with its own theme. Loads in a frame."
msgstr ""
"Vier Wochen im Voraus für ein Zeichen, jede mit eigenem Thema. Lädt in einem"
" Frame."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:184
msgid "Moon Transit Timeline"
msgstr "Zeitleiste der Mondtransite"

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:185
msgid ""
"The next seven days of Moon ingresses. Not sign-specific. Loads in a frame."
msgstr ""
"Die Zeichenwechsel des Mondes in den nächsten sieben Tagen. Nicht "
"zeichenbezogen. Lädt in einem Frame."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:189
msgid "Day the seven start from. Defaults to today."
msgstr "Tag, ab dem die sieben Tage zählen. Standardmäßig heute."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:195
msgid "Vedic Kundli"
msgstr "Vedisches Kundli"

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:196
msgid ""
"North-Indian D1 chart. Loads in a frame: there is no page-side template for "
"it yet."
msgstr ""
"Nordindisches D1-Horoskop. Lädt in einem Frame: Für die Seite gibt es noch "
"keine Vorlage."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:210
msgid "Transit Sky"
msgstr "Transithimmel"

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:211
msgid ""
"Where the planets stand on a given date. Loads in a frame: there is no page-"
"side template for it yet."
msgstr ""
"Wo die Planeten an einem bestimmten Datum stehen. Lädt in einem Frame: Für "
"die Seite gibt es noch keine Vorlage."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:222
msgid ""
"Tithi, nakshatra, yoga, karana, vara and rahu-kaal for a date and place. "
"Loads in a frame."
msgstr ""
"Tithi, Nakshatra, Yoga, Karana, Vara und Rahu-Kaal für ein Datum und einen "
"Ort. Lädt in einem Frame."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:236
msgid ""
"Life Path, Expression, Soul Urge and Personality numbers. Loads in a frame."
msgstr ""
"Lebenszahl, Ausdruckszahl, Seelenzahl und Persönlichkeitszahl. Lädt in einem"
" Frame."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:240
msgid "Full birth name. The letters are what the numbers are built from."
msgstr ""
"Vollständiger Geburtsname. Aus diesen Buchstaben setzen sich die Zahlen "
"zusammen."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:242
msgid "pythagorean (default), chaldean, kabbalistic or tamil."
msgstr "pythagorean (Standard), chaldean, kabbalistic oder tamil."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:248
msgid "Sign Compatibility Matrix"
msgstr "Zeichen-Kompatibilitätsmatrix"

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:249
msgid ""
"Every pair of signs by its classical relation, or one sign against the other"
" eleven. Rendered into the page; no key needed."
msgstr ""
"Jedes Zeichenpaar nach seiner klassischen Beziehung, oder ein Zeichen gegen "
"die übrigen elf. Wird in die Seite gerendert; kein Schlüssel nötig."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:253
msgid "One sign against the others; leave it out for all pairs."
msgstr "Ein Zeichen gegen die übrigen; weglassen für alle Paare."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:258
msgid "Synastry Compatibility"
msgstr "Synastrie-Kompatibilität"

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:259
msgid ""
"Compatibility score and the cross-aspects behind it, for two birth charts. "
"Rendered into the page; no key needed."
msgstr ""
"Kompatibilitätswert und die Aspekte zwischen beiden Horoskopen dahinter. In "
"die Seite gerendert; kein Schlüssel nötig."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:263
msgid "First person: birth date in YYYY-MM-DD."
msgstr "Erste Person: Geburtsdatum im Format JJJJ-MM-TT."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:264
msgid ""
"First person: birth time in HH:MM. Leave it out and the time is declared "
"unknown rather than guessed."
msgstr ""
"Erste Person: Geburtszeit im Format HH:MM. Ohne Angabe gilt die Zeit als "
"unbekannt, statt geschätzt zu werden."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:265
msgid "First person: latitude."
msgstr "Erste Person: Breitengrad."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:266
msgid "First person: longitude."
msgstr "Erste Person: Längengrad."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:267
msgid "First person: IANA timezone."
msgstr "Erste Person: IANA-Zeitzone."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:268
msgid "First person: name for the table heading. Stays on your server."
msgstr ""
"Erste Person: Name für die Tabellenüberschrift. Bleibt auf deinem Server."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:269
#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:330
msgid "Second person: birth date in YYYY-MM-DD."
msgstr "Zweite Person: Geburtsdatum im Format JJJJ-MM-TT."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:270
msgid "Second person: birth time in HH:MM. Optional in the same way."
msgstr "Zweite Person: Geburtszeit im Format HH:MM. Ebenso optional."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:271
msgid "Second person: latitude."
msgstr "Zweite Person: Breitengrad."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:272
msgid "Second person: longitude."
msgstr "Zweite Person: Längengrad."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:273
msgid "Second person: IANA timezone."
msgstr "Zweite Person: IANA-Zeitzone."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:274
msgid "Second person: name for the table heading."
msgstr "Zweite Person: Name für die Tabellenüberschrift."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:275
msgid ""
"How many aspects the table holds, 1 to 20. Six by default, which is what the"
" frame version showed."
msgstr ""
"Wie viele Aspekte die Tabelle enthält, 1 bis 20. Standardmäßig sechs, wie in"
" der Frame-Version."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:281
msgid "Solar Return"
msgstr "Solarhoroskop"

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:282
msgid ""
"The chart of the moment the Sun returns to its birth position in a year, "
"with houses and aspects. Without a date it asks the visitor. Needs a site "
"key or an API key; on an API key each new chart costs 50 credits."
msgstr ""
"Das Horoskop des Moments, in dem die Sonne in einem Jahr an ihre "
"Geburtsposition zurückkehrt, mit Häusern und Aspekten. Ohne Datum fragt es "
"Besucher danach. Benötigt einen Website-Schlüssel oder einen API-Schlüssel; "
"mit einem API-Schlüssel kostet jedes neue Horoskop 50 Credits."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:286
#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:305
msgid "Birth date in YYYY-MM-DD. Leave it out and the visitor gets a form."
msgstr ""
"Geburtsdatum im Format JJJJ-MM-TT. Ohne Angabe erhalten Besucher ein "
"Formular."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:287
msgid ""
"Birth time in HH:MM. Required with a date: houses turn with the minute."
msgstr ""
"Geburtszeit im Format HH:MM. Mit Datum erforderlich: Die Häuser ändern sich "
"mit jeder Minute."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:288
#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:307
msgid "Latitude of the place of birth."
msgstr "Breitengrad des Geburtsorts."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:289
#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:308
msgid "Longitude of the place of birth."
msgstr "Längengrad des Geburtsorts."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:290
#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:309
msgid ""
"IANA timezone or UTC offset of the birth; blank looks it up from the place."
msgstr ""
"IANA-Zeitzone oder UTC-Versatz der Geburt; leer wird sie anhand des Ortes "
"ermittelt."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:291
msgid "Year of the return. Blank for the one in force now."
msgstr "Jahr der Wiederkehr. Leer für das aktuell gültige."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:292
#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:311
msgid ""
"Latitude of the place the return is cast for, when it is not the place of "
"birth."
msgstr ""
"Breitengrad des Ortes, für den die Wiederkehr berechnet wird, wenn es nicht "
"der Geburtsort ist."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:293
#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:312
msgid "Longitude of that place."
msgstr "Längengrad dieses Ortes."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:294
#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:313
msgid "Timezone the moment is shown in. Blank shows it in UTC."
msgstr "Zeitzone, in der der Moment angezeigt wird. Leer zeigt ihn in UTC."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:295
#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:314
msgid "Name for the heading."
msgstr "Name für die Überschrift."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:301
msgid ""
"The chart of the next moment the Moon returns to its birth position. Without"
" a date it asks the visitor. Needs a site key or an API key; on an API key "
"each new chart costs 50 credits."
msgstr ""
"Das Horoskop des nächsten Moments, in dem der Mond an seine Geburtsposition "
"zurückkehrt. Ohne Datum fragt es Besucher danach. Benötigt einen Website-"
"Schlüssel oder einen API-Schlüssel; mit einem API-Schlüssel kostet jedes "
"neue Horoskop 50 Credits."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:306
msgid "Birth time in HH:MM. Required with a date."
msgstr "Geburtszeit in HH:MM. Mit einem Datum erforderlich."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:310
msgid ""
"The first return after this date, YYYY-MM-DD. Blank for the 1st of this "
"month, so the card holds for the month."
msgstr ""
"Die erste Wiederkehr nach diesem Datum, JJJJ-MM-TT. Leer für den 1. dieses "
"Monats, damit die Karte den ganzen Monat gilt."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:319
msgid "Davison Chart"
msgstr "Davison-Horoskop"

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:320
msgid ""
"One chart for a couple, cast for the midpoint between two births in time and"
" place. Without dates it asks the visitor for both. Needs a site key or an "
"API key; on an API key each new chart costs 50 credits."
msgstr ""
"Ein Horoskop für ein Paar, berechnet für den zeitlichen und räumlichen "
"Mittelpunkt zwischen zwei Geburten. Ohne Daten fragt es Besucher nach "
"beiden. Benötigt einen Website-Schlüssel oder einen API-Schlüssel; mit einem"
" API-Schlüssel kostet jedes neue Horoskop 50 Credits."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:324
msgid ""
"First person: birth date in YYYY-MM-DD. Leave both dates out and the visitor"
" gets a form."
msgstr ""
"Erste Person: Geburtsdatum im Format JJJJ-MM-TT. Ohne beide Daten erhalten "
"Besucher ein Formular."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:325
msgid "First person: birth time in HH:MM. Required."
msgstr "Erste Person: Geburtszeit in HH:MM. Erforderlich."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:326
msgid "First person: latitude. Required."
msgstr "Erste Person: Breitengrad. Erforderlich."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:327
msgid "First person: longitude. Required."
msgstr "Erste Person: Längengrad. Erforderlich."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:328
msgid "First person: IANA timezone; blank looks it up from the place."
msgstr ""
"Erste Person: IANA-Zeitzone; leer wird sie anhand des Ortes ermittelt."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:329
msgid "First person: name for the heading."
msgstr "Erste Person: Name für die Überschrift."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:331
msgid "Second person: birth time in HH:MM. Required."
msgstr "Zweite Person: Geburtszeit in HH:MM. Erforderlich."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:332
msgid "Second person: latitude. Required."
msgstr "Zweite Person: Breitengrad. Erforderlich."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:333
msgid "Second person: longitude. Required."
msgstr "Zweite Person: Längengrad. Erforderlich."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:334
msgid "Second person: IANA timezone; blank looks it up from the place."
msgstr ""
"Zweite Person: IANA-Zeitzone; leer wird sie anhand des Ortes ermittelt."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:335
msgid "Second person: name for the heading."
msgstr "Zweite Person: Name für die Überschrift."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:340
msgid "Vimshottari Dasha"
msgstr "Vimshottari Dasha"

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:341
msgid ""
"The running mahadasha and antardasha, with the nine antardashas of the "
"mahadasha; timeline=\"1\" adds all nine mahadashas. Drawn into the page. "
"Needs a site key or an API key."
msgstr ""
"Die laufende Mahadasha und Antardasha mit den neun Antardashas der "
"Mahadasha; timeline=\"1\" fügt alle neun Mahadashas hinzu. In die Seite "
"eingebettet. Benötigt einen Site‑Key oder einen API‑Key."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:349
#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:364
#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:378
#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:393
#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:408
msgid "IANA timezone; blank looks it up from the place."
msgstr "IANA‑Zeitzone; leer wird sie vom Ort ermittelt."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:350
msgid "1 to list all nine mahadashas from birth."
msgstr "1, um alle neun Mahadashas von der Geburt aufzulisten."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:356
msgid ""
"The ninth-part chart: its Lagna and the grahas by sign and house. Drawn into"
" the page. Needs a site key or an API key."
msgstr ""
"Das Neunte-Teil‑Chart: sein Lagna und die Grahas nach Zeichen und Haus. In "
"die Seite eingebettet. Benötigt einen Site‑Key oder einen API‑Key."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:369
msgid "Secondary Progressions"
msgstr "Sekundärprogressionen"

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:370
msgid ""
"The progressed Sun, Moon and Ascendant, every progressed planet and their "
"aspects, for today. Drawn into the page. Needs an API key; each new chart "
"costs 50 credits."
msgstr ""
"Die progressiven Sonne, Mond und Aszendent, jeder progressive Planet und "
"ihre Aspekte für heute. In die Seite eingebettet. Benötigt einen API‑Key; "
"jedes neue Chart kostet 50 Credits."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:379
msgid "Progress to this date in YYYY-MM-DD instead of today."
msgstr "Progressiere zu diesem Datum im JJJJ-MM-TT statt heute."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:384
msgid "Harmonic Chart"
msgstr "Harmonisches Chart"

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:385
msgid ""
"The natal wheel with every longitude multiplied by the harmonic, and its "
"planets. Drawn into the page. Needs an API key."
msgstr ""
"Das Geburtshoroskop mit jedem Längengrad multipliziert mit der harmonischen "
"Zahl und seinen Planeten. In die Seite eingebettet. Benötigt einen API‑Key."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:394
msgid "Harmonic from 2 to 180; 5 by default."
msgstr "Harmonisch von 2 bis 180; standardmäßig 5."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:399
msgid "Fixed Stars"
msgstr "Fixsterne"

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:400
msgid ""
"Natal planets in conjunction with 36 bright fixed stars, within a degree, "
"closest first. Drawn into the page. Needs an API key."
msgstr ""
"Geburtsplaneten in Konjunktion mit 36 hellen Fixsternen, innerhalb eines "
"Grades, nächste zuerst. In die Seite eingezeichnet. Benötigt einen API-"
"Schlüssel."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:413
msgid "Mercury Retrograde"
msgstr "Merkur rückläufig"

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:414
msgid ""
"Whether Mercury is retrograde right now, since when, and until when. Use "
"[astroway_retrograde planet=\"venus\"] for any of the other seven that "
"station."
msgstr ""
"Ob Merkur gerade rückläufig ist, seit wann und bis wann. Verwende "
"[astroway_retrograde planet=\"venus\"] für jeden der anderen sieben Planeten"
" mit Stationen."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:418
